	Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org # v6.2+
	Signed-off-by: Paulo Alcantara (SUSE) <pc@manguebit.com>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8e3554150d6c80a84b3cb046615d1a0e943811dc)
